msgid "Expense reports paid through this journal (cash register, bank or company card) book only the expenses on 542, with the employee as partner. The money handed to the employee and the refunds are recorded from the cash register or the bank statement of this journal, reconciled on 542; the balance is followed per employee on the 542 ledger, not per expense report."
